[
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 4.32,
    "text": "Yeah, so, and now I'm still trying to find somebody"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 4.32,
    "end_time": 6.6000000000000005,
    "text": "to finish teaching me rolling."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 6.6000000000000005,
    "end_time": 9.08,
    "text": "I started to learn rolls last year"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 9.08,
    "end_time": 13.0,
    "text": "and then we ran out of weather before I could really get it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 13.0,
    "end_time": 15.280000000000001,
    "text": "Well, rolling in a sea kayak,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 15.280000000000001,
    "end_time": 18.12,
    "text": "I don't even know anybody around here that rolls in sea kayak."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 18.12,
    "end_time": 20.56,
    "text": "Oh yeah, everybody, I know rolls in sea kayak."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 20.56,
    "end_time": 22.56,
    "text": "Well, no, I shouldn't say that, but yeah,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 22.56,
    "end_time": 24.72,
    "text": "I mean, sea kayak, rolling in a sea kayak"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 24.72,
    "end_time": 27.6,
    "text": "makes a lot of sense because it's a hell of a lot"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 27.6,
    "end_time": 31.040000000000003,
    "text": "more convenient to be able to roll your kayak back up again."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 31.040000000000003,
    "end_time": 35.0,
    "text": "Oh yeah, they get out and they get back in in the cold water."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 35.0,
    "end_time": 36.72,
    "text": "Yeah, so that's why I want to be able to do it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 36.72,
    "end_time": 39.120000000000005,
    "text": "I mean, it's just, it's sort of a knack, you know,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 39.120000000000005,
    "end_time": 41.44,
    "text": "you learn in a couple of hours and then you got it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 41.44,
    "end_time": 45.0,
    "text": "But it's, you know, you got to get the expertise"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 45.0,
    "end_time": 46.64,
    "text": "and you got to do the practicing and stuff."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 46.64,
    "end_time": 47.480000000000004,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 47.480000000000004,
    "end_time": 49.0,
    "text": "And so far I haven't had anybody to teach me,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 49.0,
    "end_time": 50.040000000000006,
    "text": "but I'm still working on it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 50.040000000000006,
    "end_time": 51.6,
    "text": "Well, what I've done twice this summer"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 51.6,
    "end_time": 56.6,
    "text": "is go inflatable river kayaking in an inflatable raft."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 57.6,
    "end_time": 61.04,
    "text": "It's a one-person inflatable kayak and it's just like"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 61.04,
    "end_time": 64.32000000000001,
    "text": "a little mini raft that shaped like a kayak"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 64.32000000000001,
    "end_time": 67.0,
    "text": "and there's no cockpit."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 67.0,
    "end_time": 70.36,
    "text": "It's all open and it's self-bailing."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 70.36,
    "end_time": 72.64,
    "text": "So you can take it on class three waves."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 72.64,
    "end_time": 73.96000000000001,
    "text": "How does it self-bail?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 73.96000000000001,
    "end_time": 78.36,
    "text": "Well, the floor is not attached to the sides."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 78.36,
    "end_time": 80.84,
    "text": "They're both inflated separately."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 80.84,
    "end_time": 82.64,
    "text": "They're tied together."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 82.64,
    "end_time": 85.34,
    "text": "But what happens is because the floor is inflated,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 85.34,
    "end_time": 87.82000000000001,
    "text": "the whole thing rises up with you in it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 87.82000000000001,
    "end_time": 91.3,
    "text": "And as it rises back up, the water seeks its own level."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 91.3,
    "end_time": 93.46000000000001,
    "text": "So it goes out, yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 93.46000000000001,
    "end_time": 95.78,
    "text": "But don't you have to be able to roll that?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 95.78,
    "end_time": 97.18,
    "text": "No, people don't roll it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 97.18,
    "end_time": 100.42,
    "text": "If you fall, if you fall out, you just swim up to it"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 100.42,
    "end_time": 101.74000000000001,
    "text": "and you clamber, clamber."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 101.74000000000001,
    "end_time": 102.9,
    "text": "But if you're in white water and stuff,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 102.9,
    "end_time": 104.30000000000001,
    "text": "you're going to be out of it more than you're going"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 104.30000000000001,
    "end_time": 105.22,
    "text": "to be in it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 105.22,
    "end_time": 106.82000000000001,
    "text": "Well, not in the class three."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 106.82000000000001,
    "end_time": 107.66,
    "text": "No."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 107.66,
    "end_time": 109.54,
    "text": "We don't do anything that's class four."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 109.54,
    "end_time": 110.46000000000001,
    "text": "Oh, okay."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 110.46000000000001,
    "end_time": 111.74000000000001,
    "text": "And it's incredible."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 111.74000000000001,
    "end_time": 112.82000000000001,
    "text": "It's really fun."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 112.82000000000001,
    "end_time": 114.58000000000001,
    "text": "I mean, it's just going through big waves"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 114.62,
    "end_time": 117.98,
    "text": "and having to maneuver around rocks and stuff."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 117.98,
    "end_time": 123.02,
    "text": "We went through one rapid that was maybe class three plus."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 123.02,
    "end_time": 124.74,
    "text": "Half the people made it and half didn't."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 124.74,
    "end_time": 127.46,
    "text": "I made it one day and then the next day I didn't make it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 127.46,
    "end_time": 130.22,
    "text": "And it's just a big wave you washed out of the boat."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 130.22,
    "end_time": 132.74,
    "text": "But it's really been fun."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 132.74,
    "end_time": 134.22,
    "text": "And what is this called again?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 134.22,
    "end_time": 137.46,
    "text": "This is called, this is river kayaking with an inflatable"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 137.46,
    "end_time": 138.26,
    "text": "kayak."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 138.26,
    "end_time": 138.82,
    "text": "I see."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 138.82,
    "end_time": 140.38,
    "text": "It's just like a raft."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 140.66,
    "end_time": 144.98,
    "text": "You know that hard hypolyne raft, big rafts?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 144.98,
    "end_time": 146.26,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 146.26,
    "end_time": 150.5,
    "text": "And it has an inflated seat in it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 150.5,
    "end_time": 154.1,
    "text": "And you have a regular kayak or paddle."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 154.1,
    "end_time": 157.42,
    "text": "And it's just really a blast because everybody can do it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 157.42,
    "end_time": 160.85999999999999,
    "text": "You don't have to have any river kayaking skill."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 160.85999999999999,
    "end_time": 162.74,
    "text": "Because river kayaks are tippy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 162.74,
    "end_time": 163.66,
    "text": "Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 163.66,
    "end_time": 165.82,
    "text": "And you're locked into a cockpit."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 165.82,
    "end_time": 167.74,
    "text": "You got to know what you're doing."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 167.74,
    "end_time": 170.66,
    "text": "With this, beginners have a blast."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 170.66,
    "end_time": 173.3,
    "text": "So we just have, about two weeks ago,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 173.3,
    "end_time": 177.74,
    "text": "I met about 10 friends at this campground up on the Trinity"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 177.74,
    "end_time": 181.02,
    "text": "River, not that far from Fars Glen where I used to live."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 181.02,
    "end_time": 182.86,
    "text": "This was the middle fork of the Trinity."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 182.86,
    "end_time": 185.10000000000002,
    "text": "And I used to live on the South Fork."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 185.10000000000002,
    "end_time": 186.98000000000002,
    "text": "And we camped at the campground."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 186.98000000000002,
    "end_time": 189.62,
    "text": "The next day we did our own shuttle and we went up."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 189.62,
    "end_time": 193.06,
    "text": "And we probably, it was probably about three, four hours"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 193.06,
    "end_time": 195.26000000000002,
    "text": "down the river back to the campground."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 195.26,
    "end_time": 196.78,
    "text": "And we took a lunch."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B1",
    "start_time": 196.78,
    "end_time": 199.34,
    "text": "It was just gorgeous."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 199.34,
    "end_time": 201.17999999999998,
    "text": "Yeah, it was a blast."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 201.17999999999998,
    "end_time": 203.22,
    "text": "So I've been doing that a little bit."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 203.22,
    "end_time": 205.34,
    "text": "And that's fun."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 205.34,
    "end_time": 207.94,
    "text": "But I want to get more into sea kayaking, too."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 207.94,
    "end_time": 208.42,
    "text": "I haven't."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 208.42,
    "end_time": 209.89999999999998,
    "text": "Yeah, you've got a good place down there."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 209.89999999999998,
    "end_time": 211.42,
    "text": "Yeah, there's a lot of places to go."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 211.42,
    "end_time": 212.78,
    "text": "I just haven't been going."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 212.78,
    "end_time": 214.01999999999998,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 214.01999999999998,
    "end_time": 215.73999999999998,
    "text": "How's your love life?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 215.73999999999998,
    "end_time": 218.06,
    "text": "Interesting."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 218.06,
    "end_time": 219.78,
    "text": "I'm not going out with the lawyer anymore."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 219.78,
    "end_time": 221.66,
    "text": "Yeah, you had a lady in San Francisco."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 221.66,
    "end_time": 224.89999999999998,
    "text": "No, she was actually in Oakland."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 224.94,
    "end_time": 225.94,
    "text": "Oh, OK."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 225.94,
    "end_time": 227.38,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 227.38,
    "end_time": 228.34,
    "text": "Now there's one."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 228.34,
    "end_time": 230.18,
    "text": "If they recovered from the fire down there,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 230.18,
    "end_time": 231.26000000000002,
    "text": "are they rebuilt down there?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 231.26000000000002,
    "end_time": 233.06,
    "text": "Yeah, they're pretty much all rebuilt."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 233.06,
    "end_time": 233.98000000000002,
    "text": "Oh, wow."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 233.98000000000002,
    "end_time": 234.54000000000002,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 234.54000000000002,
    "end_time": 236.98000000000002,
    "text": "Amazing."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_008.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
